  "body": "Imagine slow mornings with a coffee on the balcony, sunny afternoons in the backyard, and evenings bringing everyone together under one roof. Set on an impressive 793sqm (approx.) section with approximately 253sqm of floor area, this inviting Millwater residence offers five bedrooms, four bathrooms, including two ensuites, two living areas and a double internal-access garage. Complete with the balance of a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, it's a home where space, style and everyday comfort come naturally.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the ground floor, a striking contemporary kitchen makes an immediate impression. Rich dark cabinetry, elegant stone-look finishes and a striking stone-look island bench create a sophisticated focal point, complemented by double wall ovens and a walk-in pantry. Flowing into the spacious dining and living areas, distinctive geometric LED strip lighting adds a refined architectural touch, while the adjoining balcony offers a lovely spot to enjoy the fresh air. A heat pump keeps the open-plan living area comfortable throughout the seasons.\r\n\r\nAlso on this level are two well-appointed bedrooms, including one with its own ensuite, walk-in wardrobe and heat pump, offering a comfortable and private retreat for guests or extended family members. A separate family bathroom adds convenience to this level.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, a second family lounge introduces a more relaxed atmosphere, complete with its own heat pump and a built-in wet bar, creating an inviting setting for movie nights, casual entertaining or quiet evenings at home. The master bedroom offers a peaceful retreat with its own walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and heat pump, while two additional bedrooms share a family bathroom. The layout provides excellent flexibility for larger or multi-generational families.\r\n\r\nUnderfloor heating in the bathrooms adds an extra touch of warmth and comfort.\r\n\r\nOutside, a generous Kwila deck invites long summer lunches, weekend barbecues and relaxed evenings with friends. Beyond, the expansive backyard stretches towards a backdrop of lush greenery, offering a wonderful sense of openness and plenty of room for children to play, pets to roam or simply enjoy the sunshine.\r\n\r\nLife in Millwater comes with its own easy rhythm. School mornings are made simpler with KingsWay School and Silverdale School nearby, while weekends can be spent exploring neighbourhood walkways, enjoying a swim at Northern Arena or heading to Orewa Beach for a little coastal escape. With Silverdale's shops, cafés and everyday essentials close at hand, there's plenty to enjoy without travelling far from home.\r\n\r\nWith its generous land size, beautifully finished interiors and versatile two-level layout, this is a place where every family member can find their own space while still enjoying the moments that bring everyone together.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing and discover everything this exceptional home has to offer.",
